com/godotengine/godot/issues/101053#issuecomment-2574958967","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101053","id":2574958967,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZesF3","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T10:41:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T10:43:56Z","body":"When observing the problem, are you using the `master` branch (currently at [47f11bc](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/commit/47f11bc5c79b78c453805bcdd506d47ce163c60a)) of godot-cpp?\n\nIf so, I think the problem is that Godot 4.4-dev7 doesn't include the changes from PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100193 (merged into Godot `master`), whereas godot-cpp's `master` branch is already updated for it.\n\nGodot `master` and godot-cpp `master` are working fine together in my testing, but godot-cpp `master` is no longer compatible with 4.4-dev7. If you switch to the [27ffd8c](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/commit/27ffd8c6be614b283b1228c3f8476db25070c00f) commit of godot-cpp, then it should work with 4.4-dev7.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":